    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\r\n\r\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\r\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\r\n\r\n### Module(s)\r\n\r\nmini.tag\r\n\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nnvim-ts-autotag is a great tool for web development. The functioning itself is similar to mini.pairs and I think it would be a great addition to the mini repository.\r\n\r\nWhen i press ```>```after ```<html```\r\nHopefully it results in ```<html></html>```\r\n\r\nAlthough I know lsp will provide autocomplete after typing ```</```\r\nIt is a hassle in languages like react where we need to quickly close tag and insert a new line between the tags. ",
